{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04B950","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"登岛后的Anne和Mary似乎还目击了在地面四处奔跑的小型恐龙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"那就是蓝速龙吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对。体型小，所以动作很敏捷，不过只要有枪，似乎也不是需要害怕的对手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过，单独一只没什么了不起，一旦被包围就危险了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"应该吧。在战斗中，要扭转人数上的劣势可不是件容易的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"嗯。所以最好从一开始就小心别让它们把你包围。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"就这么办。单独潜入时，隐密行动本来就是原则。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过，就算战斗上处于劣势，单独行动在潜入方面也有独有的优势。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不愧是Boss。看来根本不需要我给建议啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"对我刮目相看了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"嗯……不过，要小心哦……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""}]}